# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# checkout platform. Without this, Windows editors can silently flip files
# between CRLF/LF depending on settings, which shows up as noisy,
# unreadable diffs that have nothing to do with the actual change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish or generated files: never diff, never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
go.sum -diff
